54
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:30,809
Part three. Danger passing.

55
00:02:31,859 --> 00:02:34,094
Fewer deaths reported in city and naval

56
00:02:34,134 --> 00:02:35,259
district.

57
00:02:38,359 --> 00:02:40,828
The epidemic of Spanish influenza in this

58
00:02:40,868 --> 00:02:43,214
