67
00:03:07,205 --> 00:03:09,390
Order closes schools, theatres, and

68
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:11,938
meeting places, in grip fight.

69
00:03:13,705 --> 00:03:16,298
All theatres, schools, churches, motion

70
00:03:16,338 --> 00:03:18,863
picture houses, dance halls, and other

71
00:03:18,903 --> 00:03:21,699
places of public gathering in Philadelphia

72
00:03:21,739 --> 00:03:24,264
must close immediately, in the hope of

73
00:03:24,304 --> 00:03:27,672
checking the spread of Spanish influenza.

74
00:03:28,722 --> 00:03:31,534
Realizing that the epidemic is spreading

75
00:03:31,574 --> 00:03:34,528
to a most alarming degree, this action was

76
00:03:34,568 --> 00:03:36,095
