77
00:03:37,445 --> 00:03:40,199
The same weeks, in other American cities.

78
00:03:40,239 --> 00:03:42,926
This is the Red Cross Motor Corps in St.

79
00:03:42,966 --> 00:03:45,379
Louis, in October nineteen eighteen.

80
00:03:45,419 --> 00:03:48,242
Masks, stretchers, and ambulances lined up

81
00:03:48,282 --> 00:03:49,700
