89
00:04:16,602 --> 00:04:19,212
Five thousand, five hundred and sixty one

90
00:04:19,252 --> 00:04:21,603
new cases, reported in the last forty

91
00:04:21,643 --> 00:04:24,252
eight hours. One hundred and seventy five

92
00:04:24,292 --> 00:04:26,643
thousand persons in city stricken, is

93
00:04:26,683 --> 00:04:27,865
estimate.

94
00:04:28,915 --> 00:04:31,215
Health Director Krusen expressed the

95
00:04:31,255 --> 00:04:33,945
belief today, that the disease had reached

96
00:04:33,985 --> 00:04:35,170
