105
00:04:58,053 --> 00:04:59,605
And the day after that.

106
00:04:59,645 --> 00:05:01,681
Church closing order modified.

107
00:05:01,721 --> 00:05:04,381
Grip on decline. Health Director Krusen

108
00:05:04,421 --> 00:05:07,789
