111
00:05:15,289 --> 00:05:17,076
The crest. The peak.

112
00:05:17,116 --> 00:05:19,269
Over the top. High tide.

113
00:05:19,309 --> 00:05:21,371
Four times in ten days.

114
00:05:21,411 --> 00:05:25,117
Each one based on the count of new cases.

115
00:05:25,157 --> 00:05:28,954
But a different number was coming in every

116
