118
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:38,967
Part five. Trebled.

119
00:05:40,017 --> 00:05:43,550
City death toll trebled by grip.

120
00:05:46,517 --> 00:05:49,227
Fatalities mount, from eleven hundred and

121
00:05:49,267 --> 00:05:52,044
ninety one, to three thousand, two hundred

122
00:05:52,084 --> 00:05:54,860
and thirty four. Influenza causing sixteen

123
00:05:54,900 --> 00:05:56,537
hundred and ninety seven.

124
00:05:56,577 --> 00:05:59,153
Pneumonia kills nine hundred and thirty

125
00:05:59,193 --> 00:06:00,195
eight.

126
00:06:01,245 --> 00:06:04,155
The week's mortality was the greatest ever

127
00:06:04,195 --> 00:06:07,034
known in Philadelphia, far exceeding last

128
00:06:07,074 --> 00:06:09,843
week's, which was the highest up to that

129
00:06:09,883 --> 00:06:10,834
time.

130
00:06:11,884 --> 00:06:14,291
The figures were given today by Health

131
00:06:14,331 --> 00:06:16,995
Director Krusen, who warned against public

132
00:06:17,035 --> 00:06:19,185
alarm, however, asserting that the

133
00:06:19,225 --> 00:06:22,207
