134
00:06:22,857 --> 00:06:25,590
Under control. Printed under the worst

135
00:06:25,630 --> 00:06:27,924
week the city had ever recorded.

136
00:06:27,964 --> 00:06:30,770
And the paper had already explained, in

137
00:06:30,810 --> 00:06:33,688
