146
00:06:54,242 --> 00:06:57,293
The deaths were still on their way.

147
00:06:58,043 --> 00:07:01,217
Part six. Less grip here.

148
00:07:02,267 --> 00:07:04,627
Wednesday, October sixteenth.

149
00:07:04,667 --> 00:07:07,667
Less grip here, reports show.

150
00:07:08,767 --> 00:07:12,222
Sixteen hundred and fifty six new cases in

151
00:07:12,262 --> 00:07:14,136
