written for the next morning's front page.

163
00:07:45,449 --> 00:07:47,916
Part seven. The record.

164
00:07:49,149 --> 00:07:51,829
This is a government weekly, called Public

165
00:07:51,869 --> 00:07:54,485
Health Reports. The issue of November the

166
00:07:54,525 --> 00:07:56,623
twenty second, nineteen eighteen.

167
00:07:56,663 --> 00:07:58,825
Cases of influenza and deaths from

168
00:07:58,865 --> 00:08:01,351
