170
00:08:05,632 --> 00:08:08,322
Philadelphia, deaths, week by week.

171
00:08:08,362 --> 00:08:10,351
Week ending October fifth

172
00:08:10,391 --> 00:08:12,847
sixteen hundred and twenty five.

173
00:08:12,887 --> 00:08:16,124
October twelfth: three thousand and sixty.

174
00:08:16,164 --> 00:08:17,606
October nineteenth

175
00:08:17,646 --> 00:08:20,727
four thousand, two hundred and eighteen.

176
00:08:20,767 --> 00:08:22,443
Then the numbers fall.

177
00:08:22,483 --> 00:08:25,642
Two thousand three hundred and forty one.

178
00:08:25,682 --> 00:08:28,232
Twelve hundred and three.

179
00:08:28,882 --> 00:08:31,920
The deadliest week of all ended on October

180
00:08:31,960 --> 00:08:34,705
