193
00:09:05,708 --> 00:09:08,210
So why did they keep calling it early?

194
00:09:08,250 --> 00:09:10,619
Not because the cases were invented.

195
00:09:10,659 --> 00:09:13,295
They counted new cases, from doctors too

196
00:09:13,335 --> 00:09:14,900
busy to report them all.

197
00:09:14,940 --> 00:09:17,510
And the deaths followed the cases, by a

198
00:09:17,550 --> 00:09:20,253
week or more. Every crest was real on the

199
00:09:20,293 --> 00:09:21,791
chart in front of them.

200
00:09:21,831 --> 00:09:24,400
It just wasn't the number that mattered

201
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,375
