202
00:09:26,425 --> 00:09:27,822
It was also wartime.

203
00:09:27,862 --> 00:09:30,767
On the same front page as the death toll

204
00:09:30,807 --> 00:09:33,783
the paper warned that the Liberty Loan was

205
00:09:33,823 --> 00:09:36,728
