210
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:48,358
But it was printed right beside them.

211
00:09:49,408 --> 00:09:51,812
So when did Philadelphia's flu peak?

212
00:09:51,852 --> 00:09:53,645
Not on September thirtieth.

213
00:09:53,685 --> 00:09:56,224
The worst week came almost three weeks

214
00:09:56,264 --> 00:09:59,007
later, after four front pages had already

215
